山がこんなに過酷だとは思わなかったのじゃ
I didn't think the mountain would be this harsh.

7325
03:50:03,208 --> 03:50:04,318
難しかった
It was so hard.

7326
03:50:04,468 --> 03:50:05,768
難しかった
So hard.

7327
03:50:06,018 --> 03:50:09,518
Oh, yeah. Salamander is don't like the cold.
Oh yeah, salamanders don't like the cold.

7328
03:50:09,648 --> 03:50:11,068
寒かったな
It was really cold.

7329
03:50:11,118 --> 03:50:12,968
寒いステージ苦手だった
