You're a salamander that doesn't climb?

7334
03:50:22,218 --> 03:50:25,568
Yes, doesn't climb salamander I am. Yes.
Yes, a salamander that doesn't climb, that's me. Yes.

7335
03:50:25,768 --> 03:50:27,468
難しかったにゃー
It was tough, meow~

7336
03:50:27,618 --> 03:50:31,268
しかもさ、この山何が難しいってさ、You guys look...
Besides, you know what makes this mountain so tough? You guys look...

7337
03:50:31,368 --> 03:50:34,568
あの、Map changes everyday.
Um, the map changes every day.

7338
03:50:34,668 --> 03:50:38,068
マップが毎日変わるの。あと10時間で変わるんだって。
The map changes every day! Apparently it changes in 10 hours.

7339
03:50:38,218 --> 03:50:42,168
そう、毎日マップが変わって、あの、日に寄ってね、
Yeah, the map changes every day, and, um, depending on the day...

7340
03:50:42,218 --> 03:50:44,568
コースが違うの。
