7372
03:52:37,368 --> 03:52:44,268
「How was meeting with senpai?」 It's really fun and they're so kind!
"How was meeting with senpai?" It's really fun and they're so kind!

7373
03:52:44,368 --> 03:52:48,668
めっちゃ優しいし、楽しかったよー！フレンドリーだし。
They're super kind, and it was so fun! Really friendly, too.

7374
03:52:49,168 --> 03:52:51,168
楽しかったのじゃ。
It was so much fun.

7375
03:52:51,368 --> 03:52:54,368
次頑張りたいと思いましたのじゃ。
